Package: epiSpace
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Autocorrelation and Hotspot Detection for Surveillance Counts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("EpiStack", "Authors", email = "epistack@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: EpiStack Authors [aut, cre]
Maintainer: EpiStack Authors <epistack@example.com>
Description: Spatial layer (L3) of the EpiStack ecosystem. Computes global
    Moran's I with permutation tests, local indicators of spatial association
    (LISA) with four quadrant classes, and significantly high/low clusters,
    using row-standardised adjacency weights from the contract layer. A BYM2
    template for INLA is emitted as code and data; INLA is not required.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: stats, utils
Suggests: epiCore
NeedsCompilation: no
URL: https://github.com/Rythonme/EpiStack
BugReports: https://github.com/Rythonme/EpiStack/issues
